1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:08,220
Every night, Daniel scrolled. Watches other people's cars, other people's house, Other people's adventures.

2
00:00:09,520 --> 00:00:12,480
And every night, he made himself the same promise.

3
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,800
Tomorrow. Tomorrow, I'll start.

4
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:33,100
But tomorrow never came. One evening, he passed an old man roasting corn by the road.

5
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:39,500
Grandpa, why are you still working so hard at your age?

6
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:53,260
Because when I was young, I kept waiting for the perfect time. Now, I wish I could buy back just one hour of my youth.

7
00:00:54,560 --> 00:01:00,240
Time is the only currency you cannot earn back. You can lose money, and make it again.

8
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:07,020
Don't wait for the perfect time. Start with the time you have.
